WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.831
In this video, you will send a sponsor one private link, then review their request and approve it.

00:00:05.831 --> 00:00:06.928
We start on the map.

00:00:07.828 --> 00:00:11.890
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.015
That is the only address you need.

00:00:16.835 --> 00:00:19.242
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:19.242 --> 00:00:22.986
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:22.986 --> 00:00:24.323
Tap Use my location.

00:00:26.086 --> 00:00:30.524
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:30.524 --> 00:00:33.728
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:33.728 --> 00:00:38.289
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:41.053 --> 00:00:43.742
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:43.742 --> 00:00:44.937
See the three dots?

00:00:44.937 --> 00:00:49.240
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:49.778
Tap them.

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:53.023
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:53.023 --> 00:00:58.361
That is where every neighborhood contest lives: the ones you can vote in, enter, or run.

00:01:00.052 --> 00:01:00.635
Tap Mine.

00:01:00.635 --> 00:01:02.266
This is your personal page.

00:01:02.266 --> 00:01:07.626
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:01:09.304 --> 00:01:11.350
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:15.022
This opens your dashboard, the control room for your contest.

00:01:16.904 --> 00:01:17.992
Tap Sponsors.

00:01:19.881 --> 00:01:22.020
First, tell sponsors how to pay you.

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:25.547
Paste your own payment link, or write where to send a check.

00:01:25.547 --> 00:01:26.067
Tap Save.

00:01:29.282 --> 00:01:30.883
Next, Invite a sponsor.

00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:32.418
Tap Create invite link.

00:01:34.587 --> 00:01:36.134
This is your private link.

00:01:36.134 --> 00:01:38.597
Tap Copy link, then send it to the sponsor.

00:01:40.441 --> 00:01:41.765
Now the sponsor's side.

00:01:41.765 --> 00:01:45.241
They open your link, no account needed, and see how to pay you.

00:01:46.043 --> 00:01:49.307
They fill in a short form, and tap Send to the organizer.

00:01:56.701 --> 00:01:59.172
Back on your side, the request waits for you.

00:01:59.172 --> 00:02:01.053
Nothing shows until you approve it.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:05.526
Once they have paid you, tap Mark payment received.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:11.922
Choose Paid to me, tick that you collected it, add the date, then tap Save sponsor.

00:02:15.511 --> 00:02:16.527
Now tap Approve.

00:02:16.527 --> 00:02:20.055
The sponsor appears on your contest page, labelled Sponsor.

00:02:22.302 --> 00:02:25.203
Next up: Presenting installer and quote requests.
